function accountQuotaSummary(list){const groups={};(list||[]).forEach(a=>acctQuotaWindows(a).forEach(w=>{const g=groups[w.label]||(groups[w.label]={label:w.label,count:0,sum:0,min:101});g.count++;g.sum+=w.remaining;g.min=Math.min(g.min,w.remaining)}));return Object.values(groups).map(g=>({label:g.label,count:g.count,avg:g.sum/g.count,min:g.min})).sort((a,b)=>a.min-b.min||b.count-a.count)}
